# Architecture boundaries

## Shared types
- All domain TypeScript types live in `packages/shared-types`
- Do NOT define domain types inline in apps/web or apps/api

## Shared schemas
- All Zod validation schemas live in `packages/shared-schemas`
- Do NOT create ad hoc inline schemas in routes or components

## Workflow config
- All rule definitions live in `packages/workflow-config/src/versions/`
- Do NOT hardcode workflow rules inside API modules or UI components

## Content
- All guidance content lives in `packages/content-bundles/src/versions/`
- Public policy and Acme operations are ALWAYS separate directories

## Backend
- apps/api is a modular monolith — use modules/, workflow/, ai/, analytics/, qa/, coaching/
- Do NOT spread workflow logic across route handlers

## Frontend
- apps/web features live in src/features/{feature-name}/
- Do NOT re-implement workflow logic in the UI — render engine outputs only
